Subject: [PATCH 3/9] fix(cloud): bind cloud load to its originating tab and
 make it retryable

- Loaded document was written to whichever tab was active when the response
  arrived. Now resolveCloudLoadTarget decides apply/store/drop per tab.
- cloudLoadStartedRef stayed true after an effect cleanup, so an abandoned
  fetch was never retried. Cleanup now resets it when nothing was produced.
- A cleanup between updateScene and the ready frame left cloudSceneReadyRef
  false forever; cleanup now completes the ready transition.
- A failed load of a background tab no longer flips the active tab's state.

Tests: stability-cloud-load-binding (4). Verified with real deps (npm ci):
vite build OK; full suite 1129 tests, 76 failing = identical set to baseline.
